<h2><b>Commonly Asked Questions:</b></h2>
<h3><b>Is DIY landscape lighting easy?</b></h3>
<p>DIY landscape lighting is relatively easy for small and simple projects, especially with solar lights. However, larger or wired systems require more planning, basic electrical knowledge, and proper installation techniques. For complex designs, hiring professionals is often the better option.</p>
<h3><b>What type of lighting is best for landscaping?</b></h3>
<p>Low voltage lighting is generally the best option for consistent performance and flexibility in design. Solar lighting is easier to install and works well for smaller areas but may be less reliable. The best choice depends on your project size and lighting goals.</p>
<h3><b>How much does DIY landscape lighting cost?</b></h3>
<p>The cost of DIY landscape lighting varies depending on the number of fixtures and type of system used. Basic setups can be relatively affordable, while larger or more advanced systems will cost more. Materials, tools, and design complexity all influence the final cost.</p>
<h3><b>Does landscape lighting add value to a home?</b></h3>
<p>Yes, landscape lighting can increase property value by improving curb appeal and outdoor usability. It creates a more attractive and functional space, especially for evening use. Well-designed lighting also enhances security, making the property more appealing to buyers.</p>

